WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.950
My first errand.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.700
I'm back!

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:28.210
Landlord!

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.380
Welcome back!

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.040
You've won today, Musubi-san.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:35.650
Yeah! This would be the tenth time in a row!

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:37.980
Tsukiumi-san, you also did a good job.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.160
Here, ahhhh...

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.730
Let me get you some fish.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:51.560
I've already said I can help myself.

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:59.440
Though it's so ordinary, it's filled with so much excitement.

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.740
Hey Matsu-san!

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:04.080
Say, Musubi-chan...

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:04.680
Yes?

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:08.710
You should once in a while let Tsukiumi...

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:09.480
I decline!

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.020
Leaving the little Kusano aside,

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:16.890
The position of "his lawfully wedded wife" is still mine.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:20.360
There wouldn't be any meaning if I hadn't fought for it.

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:22.560
That's a bit exaggerated, isn't it?

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.060
It isn't exaggerated.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.230
It's about our pride as lawfully wedded wives.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:32.540
What's the problem, Ku-chan?

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.710
I'm also his wife!

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:38.080
That's why I want to participate in the shopping race as well!

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.620
This is already her eleventh lap...

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:50.360
She's really into it...

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:53.830
But there's still a problem here.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:58.400
She's never gone out on her own before and not to mention she could also lose her way.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:01.700
She could even face more dangerous situations.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:07.240
But everything we say is useless considering the state she's in right now.

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:14.480
Ku-chan always wanted to help everybody.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:19.120
It's because she's the smallest. She wants to do her best, just like everybody else.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:23.720
I understand her feelings.

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:25.520
That's right.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.960
But all by herself... I'm still worried.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:32.560
If it's like that, let's all help her out.

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:34.270
What are you talking about?

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.010
I'm going.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.010
I'm going too.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.180
I'm off.

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:47.610
Take care!

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:49.110
Ku-chan, do your best!

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:51.480
So...

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:54.050
Let the shopping race begin!

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:03.300
Musubi, you know what to do, right?

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:08.530
Yep! I'll secretly follow Ku-chan and let her win this shopping race, right?

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:10.670
Yes, we'll postpone this match for now.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:11.970
Roger! Let's do our best!

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.680
System start.

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:22.610
No matter where she goes, I'll know where she is.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:27.050
It's good to see everybody working hard for Ku-chan.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.620
It's all because of you, Sahashi-san.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.160
Eh?

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:33.560
It's because of you that everyone's together.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:35.560
They're definitely all good children.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.400
L-Landlord...

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.870
Ku-chan's lost her way!

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:46.070
The Landlord should have put the map into her shopping bag, right?

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.770
The map's in your bag! The map!

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:51.210
Seems like she has totally forgotten about the map.

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:54.310
What's up?

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:57.680
Kusano didn't take the anticipated route.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.580
We can see that ourselves.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.790
Musubi, we'll have to do something about it.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:02.390
Sure!

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:13.430
Eh!?

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:18.840
This path is blocked; please use a different route.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:20.940
Yes!!!

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:24.410
It's best to take a look at your map, if you brought one along.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:34.090
I not only managed to solve the problem, but I also made her use the map without revealing my identity. It's perfect!

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.550
Well done, Musubi!

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:39.460
Does this even count as not revealing your identity and solving the problem?

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:42.360
If she continues walking straight, she'll reach the stores.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.800
It's smooth sailing.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.230
Ah! A kittie!

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.070
She entered the alley!

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:57.110
She seems to be chasing the cat.

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:58.110
What the-!?

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:06.990
It seems like it's going to topple any time.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.550
If this continues... D-danger-

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:13.530
She deviated from the route again...

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:16.230
Shut up! This isn't the time to be talking about that!

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:19.460
Not good!

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:26.740
What exactly are we doing?

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:29.210
Tsukiumi-san, Ku-chan is-

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:29.940
What!?

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:32.310
Not good!

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.450
Damn it! If this continues...

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:43.360
Tsukiumi-san, where are you going?

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:48.960
Why is she taking such a complicated route?

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:51.000
A cat was...

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.000
Who was it?

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.780
Water Arrow!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.780
Wouldn't it solve the problem if you made the cat run in the direction of the stores?

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.190
Let's go, Musubi!

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:13.720
Sure!

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:18.990
Water Arrow!

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:26.770
They're approaching the store already...

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.370
But... what is this...

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.840
Maruyama Supermarket

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.640
The kitty has disappeared...

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:36.980
We finally guided her to the destination...

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:40.510
Yeah... what's left is to buy carrots and potatoes.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:47.320
Could it be that Ku-chan forgot what to buy?

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:48.490
What the!?

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.020
I've got a brilliant idea.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:52.660
What is it?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:53.590
Meat

00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:58.730
Why do we have to dress up so weirdly?

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:03.070
That won't do Tsukiumi-san, you have to use a different tone of voice.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:10.310
I really feel like eating potatoes and carrots right now.

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:13.980
Me too... if I were to buy anything, I'd buy potatoes and carrots.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.050
Potatoes...

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:17.220
Carrots...

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.520
That's right! Potatoes and carrots!

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.960
Okay. What's left now is to get home.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:30.460
That's right.

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:39.640
She has finally arrived home safely...

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.310
Now let's begin the real battle.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:45.480
Sure!

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:49.280
I'm better with my explosive start, the seat on the right is mine!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.850
I won't lose either!

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.990
Who arrived first?

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.060
I wonder...

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:00.130
Where's Ku-chan?

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.430
Speaking of that...

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:03.730
Tsu-chan, Mu-chan!

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:06.330
Kusano?

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:06.330
Ku-chan?

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:09.400
Thank you!

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:15.210
Tsu-chan and Mu-chan, you secretly followed me around and helped me out a lot, right?

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:20.550
Well... it would've been surprising if that wasn't clear by now...

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:26.720
I'm not able to go shopping by myself, that's why I have lost the shopping race.

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:31.660
No, you've earned the right to his right side.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:35.060
Kusano, you did your best on your first errand.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.100
This is enough for you to have the status of his wife.

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:43.600
And for your honsety, Minato's right side will belong to you forever.

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:45.340
Is that right, Musubi?

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:46.910
Yep! That's decided then!

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:50.180
Welcome back!

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:51.510
Welcome back, Ku-chan!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.010
I'm home, Onii-chan!

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.050
Ku-chan?

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:55.950
Kusano?

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:00.290
She fell asleep.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.190
Our plan failed.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.760
We carried it out in utmost secrecy...

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:14.430
The main reason for today's failure was that we didn't understand ourselves.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:18.600
It's rare to see the three of you together.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:24.510
Since we were sweating it out together, we were reflecting on what had happened.

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:26.180
Reflecting?

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:30.620
The plan to secretly help Ku-chan failed.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:35.090
But, I feel that Tsukiumi-san and Musubi-san are really nice.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.960
You offered the place next to Sahashi-san to her.

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.530
That is...

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:43.630
Y-Yeah.

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:47.300
If it's going to be like that every time...

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:51.170
It'd be better if the shopping race was held only between the two of us.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.280
You're awake?

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.510
Where's everybody?

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:03.720
They're all waiting for you to wake up to have dinner together, so they went to take a bath first.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:11.420
Next time, let's all go shopping together and not do any racing.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.960
Yeah. You know, Onii-chan...

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:14.860
Hm?

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.930
You know, I...

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:22.400
Mu-chan, Tsu-chan and Ma-chan... I love everyone!

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:24.440
Me too.
